damaged_code:
```rust
// Attempting to spawn a future containing Rc (non-Send) 
// on a multi-threaded executor
let shared_data = Rc::new(10);
tokio::spawn(async move {
    // Compile error! Rc is not Send
    println!("{}", shared_data); 
});
```

fix:
Replace thread-local references with thread-safe atomic ones.
```rust
let shared_data = Arc::new(10);
tokio::spawn(async move {
    println!("{}", shared_data);
});
```
